WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:0% align:end size:15%
<ruby><rt>kaa.lt</rt></ruby>

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:02.627 
That mask.

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:04.254 
I can tell by the fox masks.

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:07.382 
Everyone got eaten just because
they were wearing them.

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:27.027 
<i>Total Concentration!</i>

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.862 
<i>Water Breathing!</i>

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:34.659 
<i>First Form!</i>

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.419 
<i>Water Surface Slash!</i>

00:02:18.179 --> 00:02:21.891 
EPISODE 5:
MY OWN STEEL

00:03:44.515 --> 00:03:46.142 
Urokodaki!

00:03:56.611 --> 00:03:59.530 
Dammit! Dammit! Dammit!

00:04:00.615 --> 00:04:03.868 
My body's crumbling and disappearing.

00:04:04.202 --> 00:04:05.954 
I can't stop it!

00:04:13.962 --> 00:04:15.380 
Dammit!

00:04:15.463 --> 00:04:20.051 
To think that the face of a Demon Slayer
will be the last thing I'll ever see...

00:04:25.723 --> 00:04:28.810 
How did it come to this?

00:04:33.314 --> 00:04:36.943 
I'm so scared. I'm all alone.

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:41.739 
Brother, where are you?

00:04:43.992 --> 00:04:46.202 
I want you to hold my hand!

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:48.371 
Like you always do!

00:04:49.497 --> 00:04:50.623 
<i>Why?</i>

00:04:51.165 --> 00:04:55.128 
<i>Why on earth did I bite you to death,</i>
<i>Big Brother?</i>

00:04:57.422 --> 00:04:58.548 
Huh?

00:04:59.424 --> 00:05:02.302 
Wait, who's this "Brother"?

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:11.644 
What a sad scent.

00:05:24.449 --> 00:05:25.616 
God...

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:26.951 
Please...

00:05:33.207 --> 00:05:35.585 
<i>The next time this man is reborn,</i>

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:39.964 
<i>please make sure</i>
<i>he doesn't turn into a demon.</i>

00:05:41.966 --> 00:05:43.468 
Brother!

00:05:43.718 --> 00:05:45.720 
Brother! Brother!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:48.097 
Hold my hand, will you?

00:05:49.557 --> 00:05:51.267 
What am I going to do with you?

00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:53.936 
Still such a scaredy-cat.

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:19.337 
<i>Sabito, Makomo...</i>

00:06:20.254 --> 00:06:23.549 
<i>and everyone else who was killed...</i>

00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:25.718 
<i>I won.</i>

00:06:26.511 --> 00:06:28.304 
<i>You can rest easy now.</i>

00:06:38.106 --> 00:06:41.317 
<i>I guess you're going home as promised.</i>

00:06:41.859 --> 00:06:45.404 
<i>Even if only as souls,</i>
<i>you're going back to Mt. Sagiri...</i>

00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:54.914 
<i>...and to Urokodaki</i>
<i>whom you all love very much.</i>

00:07:01.504 --> 00:07:02.839 
<i>If I'd ended up dead,</i>

00:07:03.339 --> 00:07:05.258 
<i>my soul would've returned there, too.</i>

00:07:20.773 --> 00:07:22.191 
There's something I wanna ask you!

00:07:22.984 --> 00:07:26.737 
How do I turn someone who's become
a demon back into a human?

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:39.709 
<i>Please tell me!</i>

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:42.128 
<i>How can I turn Nezuko...</i>

00:07:43.129 --> 00:07:45.089 
<i>back into a human?</i>

00:08:22.752 --> 00:08:24.587 
Wisteria?

00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:28.841 
I made it.

00:08:45.274 --> 00:08:46.734 
<i>Only four of us?</i>

00:08:47.193 --> 00:08:49.028 
<i>But there were at least twenty.</i>

00:08:50.404 --> 00:08:51.864 
<i>I don't see that guy here, either.</i>

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:57.453 
It's all because I blacked out
at that moment.

00:08:58.454 --> 00:09:00.081 
I couldn't save him.

00:09:01.249 --> 00:09:03.834 
I'm gonna die. I'm a goner.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:07.964 
Even if I survive now,
I'm gonna die in the end anyway.

00:09:09.006 --> 00:09:11.217 
-Welcome back.
-Welcome back.

00:09:16.764 --> 00:09:18.432 
Congratulations.

00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:21.060 
We're pleased to see that you're safe.

00:09:21.811 --> 00:09:25.439 
So? What am I supposed to do now?

00:09:26.315 --> 00:09:27.608 
Where's my sword?

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:31.696 
First, we shall issue you all uniforms.

00:09:32.446 --> 00:09:38.286 
We will take your measurements,
after which your rank will be engraved.

00:09:38.995 --> 00:09:42.123 
There are ten ranks in all...

00:09:42.415 --> 00:09:43.416 
Kinoe.

00:09:43.499 --> 00:09:44.458 
Kinoto.

00:09:44.542 --> 00:09:45.459 
Hinoe.

00:09:45.543 --> 00:09:46.460 
Hinoto.

00:09:46.544 --> 00:09:47.503 
Tsuchinoe.

00:09:47.753 --> 00:09:48.754 
Tsuchinoto.

00:09:49.005 --> 00:09:49.839 
Kanoe.

00:09:50.006 --> 00:09:50.840 
Kanoto.

00:09:51.048 --> 00:09:52.008 
Mizunoe...

00:09:52.258 --> 00:09:53.759 
...and Mizunoto.

00:09:54.051 --> 00:09:59.056 
Currently, you are
at the lowest rank, Mizunoto.

00:09:59.765 --> 00:10:01.100 
And our swords?

00:10:01.726 --> 00:10:07.481 
Today, you will choose the ore
for your swords.

00:10:07.565 --> 00:10:11.986 
However, the swords will take
ten to fifteen days to complete.

00:10:12.236 --> 00:10:13.070 
Are you kidding me?

00:10:13.154 --> 00:10:14.405 
But first...

00:10:23.289 --> 00:10:28.502 
We will now assign each of you
your own Kasugai Crow.

00:10:29.045 --> 00:10:31.756 
Kasugai Crow?

00:10:32.298 --> 00:10:36.761 
These Kasugai Crows can be used
primarily for communication.

00:10:37.678 --> 00:10:39.013 
Did you say "crow"?

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:40.848 
Isn't this a sparrow, though?

00:10:40.931 --> 00:10:42.600 
Don't give me that crap!

00:10:48.064 --> 00:10:50.983 
Who the hell cares about some stupid crow?

00:10:56.447 --> 00:10:58.699 
I want a sword, you hear?

00:10:58.949 --> 00:11:01.035 
Hand it over right now!

00:11:01.285 --> 00:11:03.204 
The Demon Slayers' sword!

00:11:03.454 --> 00:11:05.373 
The Color-Changing Katana!

00:11:09.877 --> 00:11:11.462 
Let go of the child!

00:11:11.796 --> 00:11:13.756 
Or else I'll break your arm!

00:11:15.591 --> 00:11:17.343 
Who the hell are you?

00:11:18.427 --> 00:11:20.096 
Wh-Wh-Wh-What should I do?

00:11:20.346 --> 00:11:22.223 
Let's see you try it!

00:11:42.159 --> 00:11:44.578 
Are you finished chatting?

00:11:51.919 --> 00:11:56.215 
Now then, please choose an ore.

00:11:58.592 --> 00:12:00.386 
The ore for the sword...

00:12:00.678 --> 00:12:03.639 
that will annihilate demons
and protect you...

00:12:03.931 --> 00:12:05.975 
will be of your own choosing.

00:12:06.392 --> 00:12:09.728 
Well, not that I'm going to live
very long. Probably.

00:12:15.943 --> 00:12:17.695 
<i>They're asking us to choose,</i>

00:12:18.404 --> 00:12:20.448 
<i>but how are we supposed to pick one out?</i>

00:12:21.699 --> 00:12:24.243 
<i>I've never seen an ore before,</i>

00:12:24.618 --> 00:12:27.288 
<i>and I can't tell the difference</i>
<i>between them.</i>

00:12:29.457 --> 00:12:31.584 
I have absolutely no clue.

00:12:51.687 --> 00:12:52.813 
I see.

00:12:56.484 --> 00:12:58.569 
As many as five of them
managed to survive, huh?

00:12:59.487 --> 00:13:01.030 
Excellent.

00:13:03.157 --> 00:13:06.076 
The number of my children
has increased again.

00:13:06.952 --> 00:13:09.413 
I wonder what kinds of swordsmen
they'll become.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.347 
<i>I was so naive.</i>

00:13:27.681 --> 00:13:31.352 
<i>None of the demons</i>
<i>were even in a state to be able to talk.</i>

00:13:32.436 --> 00:13:35.523 
<i>All they did was attack me</i>
<i>and try to kill me right away.</i>

00:13:35.898 --> 00:13:38.609 
Sorry, Nezuko.

00:13:40.528 --> 00:13:42.947 
<i>I never got to ask them...</i>

00:13:44.615 --> 00:13:46.825 
<i>how to turn a demon back into a human.</i>

00:13:52.414 --> 00:13:54.500 
<i>Even my uniform is heavy.</i>

00:13:55.417 --> 00:13:57.586 
<i>I wanna get home as soon as possible,</i>

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:00.130 
<i>but my whole body hurts!</i>

00:14:28.576 --> 00:14:29.994 
I made it.

00:14:30.661 --> 00:14:33.205 
Nezuko... Urokodaki...

00:14:43.382 --> 00:14:45.676 
Hey! Nezuko!

00:14:45.926 --> 00:14:46.886 
You...

00:14:47.303 --> 00:14:48.804 
So, you're awake?

00:14:52.057 --> 00:14:53.017 
Nezuko!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:07.740 
Why...

00:15:08.198 --> 00:15:10.576 
Why'd you fall asleep like that?

00:15:10.993 --> 00:15:13.412 
Never waking up once!

00:15:15.414 --> 00:15:17.875 
I was worried
you were going to die, you know.

00:15:25.257 --> 00:15:28.385 
You came back to us alive.

00:15:41.148 --> 00:15:44.944 
I see. You killed that morphed demon.

00:15:45.235 --> 00:15:46.195 
Yes.

00:15:48.364 --> 00:15:49.740 
At last.

00:15:52.201 --> 00:15:54.453 
I'm truly impressed that you made it back.

00:15:54.954 --> 00:15:55.955 
Yes.

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:01.669 
There are several kinds of demons.

00:16:02.252 --> 00:16:07.716 
The demons with special "Blood Demon Art"
are the ones with supernatural abilities.

00:16:09.677 --> 00:16:13.722 
You may have to fight those demons,
as well, from now on.

00:16:14.056 --> 00:16:16.475 
And battling them will be
far more difficult

00:16:16.558 --> 00:16:19.228 
than anything you've known until now.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:24.984 
Even so, Tanjiro, I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:16:26.485 --> 00:16:27.987 
Right.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:30.864 
Um...

00:16:31.031 --> 00:16:34.493 
I think that Nezuko's not
like the other demons.

00:16:34.785 --> 00:16:38.205 
Do you think it could be
one of those art something?

00:16:38.288 --> 00:16:41.166 
No, I don't think so.

00:16:41.417 --> 00:16:45.045 
I wouldn't consider it a Blood Demon Art.

00:16:45.838 --> 00:16:48.048 
<i>I'm just guessing here,</i>

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:51.593 
<i>but it could be that Nezuko's recovering</i>
<i>her strength by sleeping</i>

00:16:51.677 --> 00:16:56.098 
<i>instead of consuming human flesh.</i>

00:17:00.519 --> 00:17:03.439 
<i>I promise I'll protect you, Nezuko.</i>

00:17:12.656 --> 00:17:16.076 
15 DAYS LATER

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:32.843 
Uh...

00:17:33.093 --> 00:17:35.846 
My name is Haganezuka.

00:17:36.096 --> 00:17:38.599 
I have forged Tanjiro Kamado's sword,

00:17:38.849 --> 00:17:40.476 
and I am here to deliver it.

00:17:43.437 --> 00:17:46.482 
Um, I'm Tanjiro Kamado.

00:17:47.107 --> 00:17:47.941 
Please come inside.

00:17:48.025 --> 00:17:50.027 
This is the Nichirin Sword.

00:17:50.569 --> 00:17:52.279 
And I forged it.

00:17:52.362 --> 00:17:53.405 
Um...

00:17:53.739 --> 00:17:55.199 
Please come in
so I can serve you some te--

00:17:55.282 --> 00:17:57.326 
The materials for a Nichirin Sword

00:17:57.409 --> 00:18:00.245 
are obtained from
the mountain closest to the sun.

00:18:01.038 --> 00:18:04.792 
Scarlet Iron Sand and Scarlet Ore.

00:18:05.209 --> 00:18:09.421 
These produce steel
that can absorb sunlight.

00:18:09.588 --> 00:18:11.298 
Wow, is that right?

00:18:11.632 --> 00:18:15.385 
Mt. Yoko is bathed in sunlight
all day long, you see.

00:18:16.303 --> 00:18:17.262 
Never a cloud in the sky...

00:18:17.346 --> 00:18:21.308 
There he goes again,
never listening to what anyone says...

00:18:23.477 --> 00:18:24.937 
A hyottoko mask?

00:18:27.314 --> 00:18:31.151 
Hey, you're a Child of Brightness,
aren't you?

00:18:31.485 --> 00:18:33.987 
Now that's what I call lucky.

00:18:34.321 --> 00:18:37.783 
Oh, no, I'm the son of Tanjuro and Kie.

00:18:38.242 --> 00:18:39.993 
That's not what I meant.

00:18:40.452 --> 00:18:44.414 
See how your hair and eyes
are a reddish color?

00:18:44.832 --> 00:18:48.127 
When a kid like you is born
into a family that works with fire,

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:51.171 
it's considered lucky
and a cause for celebration.

00:18:51.421 --> 00:18:54.508 
Is that right? I had no idea.

00:18:54.925 --> 00:18:58.095 
There's a good chance
that this sword will turn red!

00:18:58.428 --> 00:19:00.180 
Right, Urokodaki?

00:19:00.639 --> 00:19:01.723 
Yes.

00:19:06.687 --> 00:19:08.689 
Come on, hurry up and draw it!

00:19:08.897 --> 00:19:13.610 
Nichirin Swords are also known
as "Color-Changing Katana."

00:19:13.944 --> 00:19:17.239 
They change color depending on the bearer.

00:19:44.725 --> 00:19:45.684 
Black!

00:19:45.767 --> 00:19:47.186 
It's black, huh?

00:19:48.061 --> 00:19:50.272 
Is it bad or something if it turns black?

00:19:51.023 --> 00:19:52.316 
Is it unlucky?

00:19:52.566 --> 00:19:55.694 
No, not necessarily.

00:19:55.777 --> 00:19:58.697 
But you don't see
this pitch black too often.

00:20:00.365 --> 00:20:04.203 
And I thought I was going to see
a bright red sword!

00:20:04.453 --> 00:20:05.829 
Dammit!

00:20:08.081 --> 00:20:10.334 
Ouch! Stop!

00:20:10.584 --> 00:20:13.420 
Please calm down!
How old do you think you are?

00:20:13.503 --> 00:20:15.714 
I'm thirty-seven!

00:20:23.931 --> 00:20:25.891 
Tanjiro Kamado!

00:20:25.974 --> 00:20:28.060 
Here are your orders!

00:20:29.019 --> 00:20:30.520 
It talks!

00:20:30.854 --> 00:20:34.274 
Make your way to a town to the northwest!

00:20:34.441 --> 00:20:38.403 
Young girls have been vanishing there!

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.172 
<i>Night after night,</i>

00:20:57.256 --> 00:20:59.466 
<i>young girls have been vanishing!</i>

00:21:00.509 --> 00:21:05.180 
Hunt down the demon
lurking there and kill it!

00:21:05.681 --> 00:21:09.935 
Tanjiro Kamado,
prepare yourself well for this task!

00:21:10.143 --> 00:21:11.937 
This is your first assignment...

00:21:12.187 --> 00:21:14.773 
as a Demon Slayer!

00:21:16.024 --> 00:21:18.610 
My first... assignment...

00:22:53.371 --> 00:22:55.749 
RUSTLE RUSTLE
PREVIEW

00:22:55.999 --> 00:22:58.627 
Kasugai Crow, say hello to everyone.

00:22:58.919 --> 00:23:02.130 
I don't take orders from you!

00:23:07.552 --> 00:23:08.678 
Jeez.

00:23:09.387 --> 00:23:12.516 
Now, it's time for a Taisho-era secret!

00:23:12.641 --> 00:23:17.020 
Forget that! It's time
for the next mission! Hurry up!

00:23:17.145 --> 00:23:19.773 
All right! I got it!

00:23:20.857 --> 00:23:23.610 
Next, Episode 6,
"Swordsman Accompanying a Demon"!

00:23:23.693 --> 00:23:27.531 
Hey, you there!
If you miss it, I'll peck you!

00:23:27.614 --> 00:23:28.532 
Hey!

00:23:28.949 --> 00:23:32.077 
TO BE CONTINUED